  </Info>
  <Properties>
    <blockList>
      <Value><![CDATA[{
  "contentData": [
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "41914047-aec3-497f-a8bd-fd6b8fabb894",
      "key": "4f82c37f-c33c-4da8-8766-63f23ddf4c33",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "text",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Ch2\u003EGet to know the sport\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EStoolball is played largely in south-east England, so if you don\u0027t know the sport you might want to start with the \u003Ca href=\u0022/{localLink:b44a85a4-5b3b-453e-b859-54e3996b0c60}\u0022 type=\u0022document\u0022 title=\u0022Rules of stoolball\u0022\u003ERules of Stoolball\u003C/a\u003E. If you want to get into more detail, our \u003Ca href=\u0022/{localLink:fac037fe-db36-4379-82ae-26ac0e79b55c}\u0022 type=\u0022document\u0022 title=\u0022Coaching stoolball\u0022\u003Ecoaching\u003C/a\u003E section has DVDs and a coaching manual that can teach you the techniques you could be passing on to others.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENext \u003Ca href=\u0022/teams\u0022\u003Efind out if there\u0027s a team near you\u003C/a\u003E. If there isn\u0027t, the obvious thing to do might be to \u003Ca href=\u0022/{localLink:37cdb4af-83de-4e51-8c2a-15efaadf570f}\u0022 type=\u0022document\u0022 title=\u0022Start a new stoolball team\u0022\u003Estart a new stoolball team\u003C/a\u003E to get people in your area active and trying something new.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2\u003EChoose what you\u0027d like to do\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOur \u003Ca href=\u0022/{localLink:2bf06466-b0a7-4183-99ec-c30614c4974e}\u0022 type=\u0022document\u0022 title=\u0022Volunteer in stoolball\u0022\u003Evolunteer in stoolball\u003C/a\u003E page has lots of ideas about how you could get involved, whether you just want to spare an hour here and there to help out, boost your CV with a project you can be proud of, or give something back to your community when you retire.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESchools are a key part of our strategy for developing stoolball. If you\u0027d like to work with schools, perhaps running taster sessions or an after-school club, take a look at our \u003Ca href=\u0022/{localLink:cc65bfac-ba67-455c-9077-896c76ea4f25}\u0022 type=\u0022document\u0022 title=\u0022Schools\u0022\u003Eschools\u003C/a\u003E section, then contact us to find out how to go about it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2\u003EDevelop your skills even further\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWe\u0027re working on Level 1 and Level 2 qualifications for stoolball coaching, meeting national standards. Let us know if you\u0027re interested in taking part.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf you\u0027d like to volunteer for us at Stoolball England and you need training in the skills required, we\u0027ll arrange it if we can. Look at our \u003Ca href=\u0022/{localLink:2bf06466-b0a7-4183-99ec-c30614c4974e}\u0022 type=\u0022document\u0022 title=\u0022Volunteer in stoolball\u0022\u003Evolunteer in stoolball\u003C/a\u003E page and see what role you\u0027d like to learn to do.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2\u003ENeed help?\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWe\u0027re happy to chat. If you\u0027re not sure what role is right for you, you want to find out more about what\u0027s involved, or you\u0027ve got an idea and you want some practical help getting started, get in touch. We\u0027ll help in any way we can to get you started with stoolball, so please\u00A0\u003Ca href=\u0022/{localLink:243a0616-2f21-4eb6-b26c-9d77631cd731}\u0022 type=\u0022document\u0022 title=\u0022Contact us about stoolball\u0022\u003Econtact us\u003C/a\u003E. We look forward to hearing from you.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "1e842305-259d-4448-b804-168859f39623",
      "key": "15bc7a03-3df3-43a8-920a-749a03ad2d78",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "text",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EIf you\u0027ve just completed your award or qualification with Sports Leaders UK, well done! So, what next? Well there are plenty of opportunities to make a real difference in stoolball.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOurs is an amateur sport run at every level by volunteers just like you. You could put your new skills to good use at a national level, working with us at the governing body to develop and publicise the sport. We do some really interesting work with everyone from individual schools and leagues right up to central government and Sport England, and even people from across the world. Or you could chip in with your local club or league, meet all the people you\u0027re helping face-to-face and make some new friends along the way.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "image",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
